<title>USA: NYS Local Gov't Authority to sell bonds Nov 19.</title>
<headline>NYS Local Gov't Authority to sell bonds Nov 19.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York State Local Governmental Assistance Corp plans to sell approximately $330 million of refunding bonds on Tuesday, November 19, a spokesman for the state comptroller said.</p>
<p>Earlier, a state official, who declined to be named, said Bear Stearns was expected to be the book-runner for the sale.</p>
<p>--Joan Gralla, 212-859-1654</p>
</text>
